# Runtime uploads go to Blob storage when deployed, so `uploads/` only holds
# local dev writes plus the seed media (amir.png, project covers).
#
# These files are NOT ignored: anything data.json references has to be committed
# or it 404s once deployed — the deployed filesystem only contains what git
# carries. Delete unreferenced dev leftovers by hand rather than ignoring them.

